WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.280
e might finally know what Devil Fruit awakening&nbsp;
really is, how it works and why using it might&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:09.900
mean paying the ultimate price for Luffy.&nbsp;
Because the One Piece Manga just dropped&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:14.880
some bombshell information about the origin&nbsp;
of devil fruits and how these fruits work.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:19.920
Which shockingly enough has gone completely&nbsp;
unnoticed by many people due to faulty English&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:25.260
translations. I’ll link the video with the full&nbsp;
literal translation at the end. But in essence,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:29.760
Dr Vegapunk reveals to the straw hats,&nbsp;
that devil fruits are born into this world&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:35.940
by people’s dreams and wishes for the future.&nbsp;
And that devil fruit users are actually beings&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:42.840
created from someone’s imagination that live in&nbsp;
a different dimension. Which is already huge,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:47.940
but on top of that we have the epic clash&nbsp;
between Luffy’s in his awakened Sun God&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:55.860
Nika state and Rob Lucci who has awakened his&nbsp;
leopard Zoan fruit, that looks like this. If&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.860 --> 00:01:01.680
you thought that the firey vapor around Luffy&nbsp;
was unique to his devil fruit ability, turns&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:07.260
out it’s not. And with Lucci’s awakening sharing&nbsp;
so many similarities with Luffy’s, we can finally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:13.920
deduce a lot about how Devil Fruit Awakening&nbsp;
actually works and why it’s so dangerous.

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:18.540
To give you a very quick overview on what&nbsp;
we know about Devil Fruit awakening so far,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:22.620
there are actually only 10 canon&nbsp;
characters that have been officially&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:28.080
confirmed as awakened devil fruits&nbsp;
users. Which is kind of crazy. 4 of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:32.640
them are the jailors in impel down. And&nbsp;
then we have Doflamingo, Katakuri, Law,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.640 --> 00:01:40.560
Kid, Luffy and Lucci. That’s it. And half of&nbsp;
them have only been revealed super recently.

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:47.400
The first time it was ever officially mentioned&nbsp;
was by Doflamingo during his fight with Luffy. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:53.880
showed us that there is a completely new level to&nbsp;
devil fruit powers, that increases their abilities&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.880 --> 00:02:00.000
immensely. This power up depends heavily on the&nbsp;
type of devil fruit you have eaten. Zoan fruit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.940
users can turn into some type of animal, like a&nbsp;
dragon, a mammoth or a leopard. giving them all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:11.400
that creatures abilities as well as generally&nbsp;
boosted power and endurance. Logia devil fruit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:16.800
users turn their body into some type of substance&nbsp;
or element, such as fire, sand or electricity. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:23.040
paramecia type devil fruits kinda lazily basically&nbsp;
cover everything else, like Big Mom Brook’s soul&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:29.160
fruits, Whitebeard’s earthquake fruit or sugar’s&nbsp;
ability to turn anyone she touches into toys. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:34.980
as Vegapunk explains, each of these fruits are&nbsp;
created because someone keeps wishing for their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:41.280
existence. The ability to turn into a dragon,&nbsp;
the ability to freeze everything or the ability&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:48.800
to turn anything into a toy. Though how this works&nbsp;
is still unclear. Vegapunk himself claims that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:54.240
is not interested in whether this is some sort&nbsp;
of ancient technology or if it’s some sort of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:59.520
magic created by a god. If you want to feel like&nbsp;
a god, if you hit subscribe under this video,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:04.740
I will pay my respects by offering you high&nbsp;
quality one piece videos every single week.

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:11.280
As Doflamingo shows us awakening your powers as a&nbsp;
paramecia user means that his abilities would not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:17.640
only affect his body, but also the environment&nbsp;
around him and amplify the ability’s powers.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:24.240
As a result, he was able to transform any&nbsp;
objects around him into controllable strings,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:29.940
that he could also manipulate without being in&nbsp;
contact with them. Similarly Katakuri was able&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:36.120
to transform the area around him into Mochi&nbsp;
and control it as part of his body. Kid could&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:40.020
affect his environment with his magnetic&nbsp;
powers. Meanwhile for someone like law,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:43.680
Instead of creating a ROOMs in&nbsp;
which he usually controls objects,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:49.200
in his awakened state, Law can apply his&nbsp;
manipulation field, on objects like his sword,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:55.020
which he calls KROOM. That way the sword now&nbsp;
gains the same spatial manipulation abilities,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.020 --> 00:04:00.600
that usually only work with ROOM around&nbsp;
him. For example. using a technique&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:05.760
called "Anesthesia" he enables his sword to&nbsp;
spatially phase through anything without even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:12.300
making a wound or creating an incision,&nbsp;
thereby bypassing any type of defense.

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:18.840
So far, we have seen no officially confirmed&nbsp;
example of an awakened Logia fruit user. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:24.360
it’s widely speculated, that an awakened Logia&nbsp;
user would be able to not only turn his body into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:30.120
an element, but similar to paramecia types, also&nbsp;
affect the environment around them. For instance,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:36.420
Punk hazard’s climate used to be a jungle island,&nbsp;
but after the battle between Aokiji and Akainu,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:41.640
it ended up being half frozen waste&nbsp;
land and half firey lava field.

00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:46.560
Zoan fruits on the other hand work a bit&nbsp;
differently. While we first really learned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:53.220
about Awakening on Dressrosa, the first time this&nbsp;
was actually mentioned was by Crocodile during&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.220 --> 00:05:00.540
Luffy’s prison break from Impel down. The 4 jailor&nbsp;
beasts, a cow, a koala a rino and a zebra, are 4&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:06.960
awakened zoan devil fruit users. This basically&nbsp;
turns them into giant monster like versions of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:13.620
their respective animals, but with certain human&nbsp;
features remaining, like arms and legs. These&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:20.700
awakened users act on pure animal instincts and&nbsp;
have lost their human will. This of course is very&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:26.220
similar to chopper’s monster point form before&nbsp;
the time skip, which has lead to the generally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:31.620
accepted theory, that Choppers monster point&nbsp;
is an artificially created state of awakening.

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:36.000
However, we now have at least two more&nbsp;
examples of awakened Zoan fruit users,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:42.060
that are nothing like Monster point chopper&nbsp;
or the impel down guards, that completely lose&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:47.760
their human nature. With Luffy’s awakening of his&nbsp;
mythical Nika devil fruit, we can definitely see&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:53.760
a personality change in Luffy, but he still&nbsp;
is himself and aware of his goals. Whether&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:59.460
that is defeating Kaido or keeping Lucci from&nbsp;
murdering more people in vegapunk’s lab. Now&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:05.880
originally, this could simply have been explained&nbsp;
by Luffy having eaten a human devil fruit. And a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:11.880
mythical one at that. But now, with Rob Lucci’s&nbsp;
awakening, we have confirmation, that it’s very&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:17.580
much possible to retain mental control in your&nbsp;
awakened state. Lucci doesn’t look at all like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:24.060
the brainless monster versions of the impel down&nbsp;
animals. Instead his leopard has grown slim and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:32.700
powerful looking. And even more human than his&nbsp;
hybrid form. And he has the same wheel of flame&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:39.120
and smoke around him as Luffy has in his Gear 5&nbsp;
state. So it seems that, at least for Zoan fruits,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:45.000
there are 2 paths to awakening: One where you lose&nbsp;
control and the spirit of the animal consumes you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:50.700
and one where you unlock the animal’s full&nbsp;
potential while staying in control yourself.

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:56.580
Now even though Luffy and Lucci are the only&nbsp;
two characters with this form that have been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:56.580 --> 00:07:02.220
officially confirmed as awakened, there are two&nbsp;
more likely candidates. The more obvious of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:08.640
two is Yamato, son of the Yonko Kaido. She has&nbsp;
eaten the mythical dog fruit model Okuchi no&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:14.760
Makami, which is a divine wolf. When she is facing&nbsp;
her father in battle, because Luffy fell into the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:20.820
ocean, Yamato seems to be in her hybrid form.&nbsp;
However since we have seen Lucci with the same&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.820 --> 00:07:27.780
slim figure and vapor coat around him, it’s pretty&nbsp;
safe to say that this is actually her awakened&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:32.820
form. Which would make sense, because how else&nbsp;
would Yamato be able to keep her father at bay.&nbsp;

00:07:32.820 --> 00:07:39.300
And Kaido himself is of course the second possible&nbsp;
awakening. To everyone’s surprise, Kaido was never&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:45.840
confirmed to have awakened his devil fruit.&nbsp;
And it’s possible he never did. After all,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:51.300
the fight against Kaido was mostly a battle&nbsp;
of Armament and Conqueror’s Haki. And Kaido&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.300 --> 00:07:56.760
also seems to lack the vapor coat that&nbsp;
Luffy, Yamato and Lucci have. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:56.760 --> 00:08:03.060
Kaido does have 2 distinct hybrid forms. One&nbsp;
that looks a lot more like his human form and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:09.180
one that looks a lot more like a dragon face&nbsp;
with human features. That second form also has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:09.180 --> 00:08:15.420
flame patterns, like the eyebrows, similar to the&nbsp;
flame shape on Lucci’s fur. Interestingly enough,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:25.920
in his Dragon form, Kaido does have the vapor coat&nbsp;
and the flame shaped fur, like Lucci. So i would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:32.880
simply speculate based on that, that Kaido was&nbsp;
indeed awakened, as the king of beasts should be.

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:39.300
But that still doesn’t explain what Awakening&nbsp;
truly is. From Doflamingo and Katakuri,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:42.420
we know that awakening one’s&nbsp;
devil fruit, at least naturally,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:48.840
requires a certain power level, as well&nbsp;
as a great mastery of one’s ability.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:53.340
And we also know from Law and Kid, that&nbsp;
fighting in one’s awakened state takes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:58.680
a huge toll on the user’s body and energy&nbsp;
and can only be used for a limited time.

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:04.320
But the key here i think is Vegapunk’s&nbsp;
explanation. Devil fruit powers basically&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:09.840
tap into abilities that exists in a different&nbsp;
dimension. Oda literally uses the word different&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:14.640
dimension in the manga by the way. Vegapunk&nbsp;
also goes into even more detail with Luffy’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.640 --> 00:09:18.780
nika fruit. He explains that even though&nbsp;
Nika’s name has been erased from history,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:19.560 --> 00:09:24.240
long as people keep wishing for his&nbsp;
existence he can never be erased.

00:09:24.780 --> 00:09:29.520
It seems like eating a devil fruit means that a&nbsp;
user not only takes on the abilities that have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:36.420
been wished for, but also the reason for why&nbsp;
it was wished for. In other words, based on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:41.400
Vegapunk’s explanation, devil fruit users seem&nbsp;
to inherit the will of those who wished for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:47.400
power in the first place. Kaido tells luffy that&nbsp;
awakening happens when the mind catches up to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:52.740
devil fruit. And Oda himself had actually revealed&nbsp;
something very similar to this in the road to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.740 --> 00:09:57.900
laugh tale booklets, while the manga was on break.&nbsp;
He explained that the downside of Zoan awakenings&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:57.900 --> 00:10:04.740
is that the 'innate nature of the animal' can&nbsp;
consume the user if they're not careful. Which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:04.740 --> 00:10:13.380
seems to be exactly what happened with the guards&nbsp;
at impel down or chopper. And it’s something that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:19.560
seems to be quite dangerous for Luffy as well. If&nbsp;
the Nika fruit is born by people wishing for it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:27.960
that explains Luffy strange behavior while in gear&nbsp;
5. Who’s Who, the person who was supposed to guard&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:34.020
the Nika fruit for the government before it was&nbsp;
stolen by Shanks, tells Jinbei about Nika. That&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:39.120
he is legendary figure that slaves pray to in the&nbsp;
hope that he would bring smiles to their faces and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:44.340
free them form their suffering. He also mentions&nbsp;
that he doesn’t know whether or not he actually&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:44.340 --> 00:10:51.540
existed or if he was dreamed up. Which was of&nbsp;
course perfect foreshadowing for this reveal.

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:57.540
So what seems to be happening here, is that the&nbsp;
essence of Nika is bringing smiles to people’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:57.540 --> 00:11:04.920
faces and freeing them from suffering. The&nbsp;
citizens of Wano literally wished for that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:11.820
and it was Luffy’s promise and purpose in his&nbsp;
fight against Kaido to do just that. Therefore&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:17.820
Luffy could only awaken his devil fruit once&nbsp;
he truly embodied the essence of his devil&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:22.680
fruit. So while Luffy hasn’t been overtaken&nbsp;
by his fruit, like the impel down jailors,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:31.860
he seems to still be a different person. Normally&nbsp;
Luffy takes big fights very seriously. But in his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:31.860 --> 00:11:37.680
awakened state, he can’t stop laughing and&nbsp;
uses his powers in quirky ways that he finds&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:46.620
amusing. He takes things too lightly, overseeing&nbsp;
that Lucci is attacking Sentomaru. Which could&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:53.160
well be the true nature of the sun god nika&nbsp;
trying to take over. This might we a major&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:53.160 --> 00:12:00.000
risk for Luffy going forward: Losing control&nbsp;
and having Nika slash Joy Boy come out instead.

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:06.360
But it’s not only Luffy. Devil Fruits carrying&nbsp;
the will of those who dreamed them up explains why&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:06.360 --> 00:12:15.060
pretty much any devil fruit user fits his fruit&nbsp;
almost perfectly personality wise. Doflamingo has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:21.360
the string fruit and is extremely manipulative.&nbsp;
Yamato who is the guardian deity of Wano, a dog,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:21.360 --> 00:12:27.780
is extremely loyal, straightforward and decides&nbsp;
to put the safety of Wano over their desire to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:33.000
go out to sea. Both big mom and mother caramel&nbsp;
had the soul soul fruit and loved to control&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:40.560
people’s lives and existence. Akainu has the magma&nbsp;
fruit and is boiling over with hot rage. The list&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:40.560 --> 00:12:47.760
goes on and on. So awakening one’s devil fruit,&nbsp;
might simply mean becoming one with the original&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:54.480
will behind its creation. Maybe the ones who&nbsp;
dreamt of the string fruit, wanted to control&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:55.260 --> 00:13:00.540
things. And doflamingo became so controlling&nbsp;
and manipulative, that he was able to tap into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:06.840
the fruits full potential after being perfectly&nbsp;
aligned with it. Or in Lucci’s case, someone who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:13.320
would dream up a leopard would want to hunt and&nbsp;
kill their prey. Lucci was always a bloodthirsty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:13.320 --> 00:13:19.800
hunter and at some point, he matched the nature of&nbsp;
his devil fruit so well, that he could awaken it.

00:13:20.340 --> 00:13:26.160
That works really will with the idea of mastering&nbsp;
ones fruit too. Because mastering one’s fruit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:32.460
means nothing else than using it in the way that&nbsp;
it was meant to be used. The only real question&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:32.460 --> 00:13:39.960
now, is HOW exactly people’s dreams and wishes&nbsp;
are turned into actual abilities in one piece.

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:43.680
I have personally translated&nbsp;
Vegapunk’s full lecture about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:48.840
devil fruit from Japanese and discuss&nbsp;
this question and much much more in a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:52.740
lot of detail in this video right here.&nbsp;
So check that out if you’re interested.

